{{apichanges|prev=12.1.5|12.1.7|next=12.2.0}} {{#description2:12.1.7 (70424) Oct 16 2026}}

==Summary==
* Includes API changes from [[Patch 1.60.1/API changes|Patch 1.60.1]].
* The server ID and spawn ID portions of cast, creature, vehicle, pet, and game object GUIDs have been replaced with obfuscated values.
** Obfuscated values are stable and unique within the current client session, but cannot be compared between clients or persisted beyond restarts.
** The GUID string format is otherwise unchanged.
** ''This change will be available for testing in a future build of 12.1.7.''
* TOC directives no longer expand variables such as <span class="apitype">[Game]</span> or <span class="apitype">[Family]</span>. Instead, these lines are entirely skipped.
** Directives containing conditional expressions such as <span class="apitype">[AllowLoadGameType ...]</span> continue to function normally.

